WEBVTT

NOTE push-to-lynx: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

V0-1
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:06.180
Review every pending adjustment,
drop the ones you do not want,

V0-2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.240
and send the rest to the controller.

V1a-1
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.229
The button counts the enabled stations
whose percent adjustment differs

V1a-2
00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:21.046
from what Lynx holds, whether you
edited it or left the suggestion,

V1a-3
00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.200
leaving out any already pushed today.

V1b-1
00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:27.702
Beside it, the green counter shows
how many have already gone out today.

V1b-2
00:00:27.802 --> 00:00:30.817
If Push Changes is greyed out,
there is nothing queued.

V2a-1
00:00:37.253 --> 00:00:41.203
The dialog puts the current value on
the left and the change on the right.

V2b-1
00:00:41.753 --> 00:00:45.568
Available to Push comes first,
with everything ticked.

V2b-2
00:00:45.668 --> 00:00:49.766
Pushed Today follows, unticked.
Tick a pushed station only

V2b-3
00:00:49.866 --> 00:00:53.753
if you genuinely mean to
adjust it a second time today.

V3a-1
00:00:59.117 --> 00:01:04.223
If a minimum threshold is set, a pink
banner counts the stations it altered.

V3a-2
00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:07.481
Each affected row shows
the original percentage

V3a-3
00:01:07.581 --> 00:01:10.337
and the value that will actually be sent.

V3b-1
00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:14.520
Review Threshold opens Settings on the
threshold tab if the numbers look wrong.

V4a-1
00:01:22.253 --> 00:01:24.793
The footer button counts
only the ticked rows,

V4a-2
00:01:24.893 --> 00:01:28.153
so it always names the number
of changes that will be sent.

V4b-1
00:01:28.653 --> 00:01:31.081
Unticking is not the same as reverting.

V4b-2
00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:36.413
The station keeps its edited value in the
table and will be offered again next time.

V5a-1
00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:46.491
Spatial Adjust writes
station by station first,

V5a-2
00:01:46.591 --> 00:01:52.280
then reads the adjustments back from Lynx
and checks each one against what it sent.

V5b-1
00:01:52.837 --> 00:01:56.617
Failed stations are retried automatically
before the run is declared finished.

V6a-1
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:06.500
A successful run confirms every
selected change reached Lynx.

V6b-1
00:02:07.057 --> 00:02:10.941
A failure names the number of
stations that could not be updated.

V6b-2
00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:15.343
Check the Lynx connection, then reopen
Push Changes: the failed stations

V6b-3
00:02:15.443 --> 00:02:19.807
are listed under Pushed Today, unticked,
so tick them to send them again.
